              is uniquely fixed by its value on any point in that path component.
            %p Choosing a basepoint in each path component therefore induces bijection
            .maruku-equation
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
